<div class="page-heading admin-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Communication</span><h1>Email delivery log</h1><p>Delivery metadata and safe previews for non-sensitive messages.</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><a class="button button-outline" href="<?= url('admin/settings') ?>">SMTP settings</a></div></div>
<div class="report-notice"><span>i</span><p>Authentication messages never retain OTPs, verification links, reset tokens or message bodies. With <b>MAIL_DRIVER=log</b>, secret-bearing messages are suppressed; configure authenticated SMTP before accepting registrations.</p></div>
<section class="card mail-list"><?php if(!$messages):?><div class="empty-state"><span>✉</span><h2>No email messages yet</h2><p>Non-sensitive previews and authentication-message delivery metadata will appear here.</p></div><?php endif?><?php foreach($messages as $message):?><details><summary><span class="mail-status <?= e($message['status']) ?>">●</span><div><b><?= e($message['subject']) ?></b><small>To <?= e($message['recipient']) ?> · <?= format_date($message['created_at'],true) ?></small></div><span class="status-pill status-<?= e($message['status']) ?>"><?= e(ucfirst($message['status'])) ?></span><i>⌄</i></summary><div class="mail-preview"><?php if(!empty($message['sensitive_redacted'])||$message['body_html']===null):?><p><b>Message body redacted.</b> Delivery metadata is retained, but authentication secrets and links are never stored.</p><?php else:?><p><?= nl2br(e(trim(strip_tags((string)$message['body_html'])))) ?></p><?php endif?><?php if(!empty($message['correlation_id'])):?><small>Correlation: <code><?= e($message['correlation_id']) ?></code></small><?php endif?></div></details><?php endforeach?></section>
